        // The Sunspear's Pinch-fusion Cannon, heard 2.2 s before its one shot: the plasma
        // squeezed until it fuses. It starts low and quiet so the end can be big: a deep
        // field clunk, the air drawn in, a gravity heave throbbing slowly under a growl
        // that fills and only leans up, then the core going white: a fizz spreading up
        // into the highs, crackle thickening at random (never on an even beat) and an
        // overload growl an octave up, until the pinch slams shut on the launch.
